# Build choices of this unit for boot/build-dev-image.sh (sourced after rootfs/board/dho/etc/oos-board).
# The boot card in UHS-I (SDR104) as under the patched stock kernel (kernel/dts/rk3399-rigol-dho900-uhs.dts).
OOS_KERNEL_DTB=rk3399-rigol-dho900-uhs.dtb
# Opt-in, not verified on the unit: PCIe MaxPayload 256 B on the FPGA link (root port limit; both ends run 128 B). The
# kernel sets it when the PCIe host module enumerates the FPGA (docs/fork/specs/10-transfer-efficiency.md 3.7).
# OOS_BOOTARGS_EXTRA="pci=pcie_bus_perf"
